  <!-- SCORING -->
  <h2>1 · Why 7 August - the date scoring</h2>
  <p>Every candidate Friday from June to August was scored 0-10 on five weighted factors. For a star-light, content-driven thriller, <strong>competition clearance</strong> and <strong>screen runway</strong> dominate, because losing screens kills word-of-mouth before it compounds.</p>
