  <p>Every drop is scheduled on India's <strong>highest-engagement days</strong> (Tuesday &amp; Wednesday) at an <strong>evening slot (5-6 PM IST)</strong> so the asset accumulates views straight into the 7-10 PM prime-time scroll, trends overnight, and gets picked up by next-morning trade news. The trailer is the exception - placed on a <strong>Friday evening</strong> to ride the weekend. The <code>:05 / :06</code> minute is the Tollywood convention (a memorable timestamp that dodges the on-the-hour clutter of competing posts).</p>
